    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but why does the \"rebuilding\" part even matter? i don't want to spend years trying to find a new version of myself that's just... less. i'm tired of trying to force a life out of nothing. sometimes i look at my body and i just think, if the athlete is gone, why is the person still forced to stay? it feels like staying here is just dragging around a corpse.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
